                              "alignItems": "center",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "SjiXX",
                                  "name": "Pre",
                                  "fill": "$ink",
                                  "content": "neutrality in favor of ",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.62,
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                                  "fontSize": 18,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "frame",
                                  "id": "oPgiV",
                                  "name": "Chip",
                                  "fill": "$yellow",
                                  "padding": [
                                    1,
                                    5
                                  ],
                                  "alignItems": "center",
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "jI4vk",
                                      "name": "Chip Txt",
                                      "fill": "$ink",
                                      "content": "graphic bluntness",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.62,
                                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                                      "fontSize": 18,
                                      "fontWeight": "600"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "w5zZZ",
                                  "name": "Post",
                                  "fill": "$ink",
                                  "content": ":",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.62,
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                                  "fontSize": 18,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "dYF71",
                              "fill": "$ink",
                              "content": "high-contrast palettes, bold typography,",
                              "lineHeight": 1.62,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 18,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "RNgUC",
                              "fill": "$ink",
                              "content": "strongly defined shapes, and conspicuous",
                              "lineHeight": 1.62,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 18,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "GoRWd",
                              "fill": "$ink",
                              "content": "structure — especially outlines and hard",
                              "lineHeight": 1.62,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 18,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "tmp1H",
                              "fill": "$ink",
                              "content": "shadows.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.62,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 18,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "f5dKn",
                          "name": "Para 2",
                          "fill": "$ink",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Unlike earlier web brutalism, which was often deliberately raw, awkward, and anti-conventional, neubrutalism translates that rebellious energy into a repeatable, commercially usable interface grammar. The interface doesn't disappear into frictionless neutrality — it declares its presence.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.62,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": 18,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "RF3di",
                          "name": "Para 3",
                          "fill": "$ink",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Its core philosophy: explicitness over subtlety, personality over invisibility, and memorable structure over perfect polish. Good neubrutalism is intentionally emphatic, not accidentally clumsy.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.62,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": 18,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "K7Y6tB",
