                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Webflow has dedicated Neobrutalism categories. GitHub hosts open-source component libraries. Framer's marketplace has thousands of tagged templates. First-wave web brutalism was anti-system; neubrutalism became system-friendly — it spread precisely because it became easier to reproduce.",
