                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 720,
                      "content": "One of the reasons neubrutalism spread so fast is that its grammar is simple, discrete, and component-friendly. Borders, square corners, offset shadows, and loud fills are trivial to express in CSS. Here's how.",
