                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rQZgO",
                  "name": "Intro",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 720,
                  "content": "Neubrutalism's central UX tension: it gains distinctiveness by violating expectations, but usability depends on reliably managing them. The more an interface emphasizes collision and visual noise, the more carefully it must protect hierarchy, affordance, and reading order.",
