                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "A80Omj",
                      "name": "Universal P",
                      "fill": "#000000",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The most likely future is hybridization: neubrutalist energy on marketing surfaces, calmer interaction models in dense product flows. Minimalism remains the better default for dense products and regulated industries.",
