                      "fill": "#000000",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A 2026 accelerant is anti-AI signaling: as AI-generated layouts make polished sameness ubiquitous, visibly hand-built aesthetics read as a human signal, helping the style outlast predictions of its death.",
