                              "fill": "#000000",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Minimalism optimizes for calm, efficiency, and universal deployability. It's the better default for dense products and regulated industries. Neubrutalism is not a replacement — it's an expressive overlay.",
