                              "fill": "#000000",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Where Corporate Memphis says 'don't worry, we're approachable,' neubrutalism says 'notice us, we are not generic.' It's sharper, less utopian, more confrontational — design as stance rather than comfort.",
