                              "fill": "#000000",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Glassmorphism is a single rendering trick (frosted translucency). Neubrutalism is a grammar (stroke, depth, type hierarchy, layout). That makes it more adaptable long-term — but it will still cycle based on cultural fatigue.",
